cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this extension, please cite it as below."
title: "duckdb-luajit: In-Process JIT-Compiled Lua UDFs for DuckDB"
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Hongyan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alitrack/duckdb-luajit"
url: "https://community-extensions.duckdb.org/extensions/luajit.html"
abstract: >-
  A DuckDB extension providing in-process JIT-compiled Lua UDFs via LuaJIT:
  per-thread lua_State pools, a trusted sandbox, chunk-batched scalar and
  aggregate functions (including GROUP BY), LIST/STRUCT/MAP nested-type
  bridges, and an embedded Fennel compiler. Distributed as an official
  DuckDB community extension.
keywords:
  - DuckDB
  - LuaJIT
  - UDF
  - just-in-time compilation
  - database extension
license: MIT
type: software
version: 0.32.5
date-released: "2026-09-28"
